# Canvas Behavior Guardrails

- Respect existing persistence, collaboration, selection, and viewport behavior when editing feature code.
- Prefer extending current shortcuts, menus, and toolbar controls instead of introducing parallel interaction patterns.
- Keep new UI text short and action-oriented so the canvas stays lightweight.
- Avoid changes that silently discard user data, history, or in-progress edits.
